    "insert": " would not only maintain a more scientific tone but also strengthen the methodology section with clearer links to the research questions.\n\nThe paper outlines a very promising roadmap with plans for experiments, surveys, and interviews. These steps indicate a good understanding of the difficulty of assessing the selected topics. The acknowledgment of challenges is present and further demonstrates the author’s knowledge of the topic. The timeline is clear and seems realistic.\nTo further enhance the next steps, it would be beneficial to clearly and precisely formulate an overarching research question and a few sub-questions that will inevitably be answered or addressed through the main research question.\nThis would help provide a clearer structure and resolve the currently unclear structure of the interviews.\n\nAll in all, the research topic is highly relevant and presents a promising concept. Refining the focus, aligning the methodology more clearly with the research questions, and maintaining an academic tone will significantly strengthen the overall quality and impact of the paper."
